{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qnrqpl","slide":1,"text":"CampusFix is a proposed web or app-based system for campus maintenance. Students report issues, the admin prioritizes and assigns work, maintenance staff update progress, and students confirm the outcome and provide feedback. Team names reproduce the supplied spelling."}
